The SLC611 LED Lighting Driver provides remote on/off control with 0~10V dimming, and enables scheduling for automatic switching. It works with dimmable LED lights.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA 1.2 compliant
- Remote on/off control
- 0~10V dimmable
- Enables scheduling for automatic switching
- 110~277 VAC power input
- Compact 140 x 50 x 30mm design, 120g
